    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. _class_registry is filled during the same sequential walk that reads it (puppet.py:136-142, 212, 470-483). class alpha { include beta include zeta } with beta lower in a.pp and zeta in z.pp gives two is_resolved=False edges though both classes exist. v10."  # 374d
